  "operatingHours": "Metro and trams run ~6:00 AM–midnight daily. On Friday and Saturday nights metro lines M1A, M1B, M2, M4, M5, M6 and M7 keep running all night (non-stop from Friday 6:00 AM to Sunday midnight); trams, M11 and Marmaray stop around midnight.",
  "fareInfo": "Pay with an Istanbulkart (sold and topped up at station machines; card fee extra): a full-fare ride on an anonymous card is ~46 TL (2026), with discounted transfers within 2 hours. One card can be tapped for several people. Single-use electronic tickets from machines cost more (1 ride 65 TL, 5 rides 275 TL). The M11 airport line and Marmaray charge by distance, so an airport trip costs more. Fares rise once or twice a year.",
